# OPL-1.2 NOTICE File Example
# ============================
#
# This is an EXAMPLE of a NOTICE file for a project licensed under the
# Open-Pact License v1.2 (OPL-1.2). It is a template.
#
# How to use this file:
#   1. Copy this file to NOTICE in the root of your project repository.
#   2. Replace the placeholder values with your real values.
#   3. Remove every line that begins with "#" (these are comments).
#   4. Keep every line that does NOT begin with "#".
#   5. Optional fields may be removed entirely; do not include them at all.
#
# Per OPL-1.2 §13, your NOTICE must include at minimum:
#   - Maintainer's name and reachable contact
#   - Governing Jurisdiction (new in v1.2; required by §12)
#   - Reciprocity rate (or a statement that the default 5% applies, or a waiver)
#   - Reciprocity payment address
#
# The following are optional:
#   - OPL-AI addendum opt-out (a single line; omitting it means OPL-AI applies)
#   - Trademark notice
#   - Small-scale carve-out override under §3.3
#
# For the full OPL-1.2 license text, see LICENSE.md.
# For an explanation of the Reciprocity default and waiver mechanism, see LICENSE.md §3.4.
# For the OPL-AI addendum, see OPL-AI.md.
# For the Hosted Service small-scale carve-out, see LICENSE.md §3.3.

# ----- REQUIRED FIELDS -----

Maintainer: Your Name <[email protected]>
Governing Jurisdiction: California, United States
Reciprocity: 5% (default) of Revenue attributable to any Derivative You distribute
Reciprocity Payment Address: 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 (Ethereum, ENS, bank wire, or other)

# ----- OPTIONAL FIELDS -----
# Uncomment and fill in any of the following. Remove any you do not need.
# A line that begins with "#" is a comment and will be ignored; remove the
# leading "#" to make a line active. To remove an optional field entirely,
# delete the line.

# OPL-AI: opted out. AI training is permitted under the same terms as other use.
# Trademark Notice: "FooBar" is a trademark of Your Name. See https://example.com/trademark-policy for permitted use.
# Small-Scale Carve-Out: Removed. The default $5,000 / 10,000 MAU exemption in OPL-1.2 §3.3 does not apply to this project.
# Reciprocity Waiver: Reciprocity is waived for this project.
# Designated Successor: Your Successor's Name <[email protected]>

# ----- ALTERNATE EXAMPLES (delete this entire section when finalizing your NOTICE) -----
#
# Reciprocity: 2% of Revenue attributable to any Derivative You distribute
# Reciprocity: 0% (waived)
# Reciprocity Payment Address: yourname.eth (ENS name)
# Reciprocity Payment Address: [email protected] (bank wire on request)
# Reciprocity Payment Address: GitHub Sponsors at https://github.com/sponsors/yourname
#
# Governing Jurisdiction: England and Wales
# Governing Jurisdiction: Delaware, United States
# Governing Jurisdiction: New South Wales, Australia
# Governing Jurisdiction: Berlin, Germany
#
# Trademark Notice: "FooBar" and the FooBar logo are trademarks of Your Name. All rights reserved.
# Trademark Notice: This project is not affiliated with the FooBar Foundation.
